# Magecraft is for instant and sorcery spells you cast or copy. Bot1 casts an Ornithopter (creature spell) and a Sol Ring (artifact
# spell) after the Apprentice with no drain, and Bot2's Lightning Bolt on turn 2 drains nothing for Bot1 either (not "you").
# Bot1's own Lightning Bolt at Bot2 on turn 3 does (the control): Bot2 loses 3 and 1 to the drain (16), Bot1, at 17 after
# Bot2's Bolt, gains 1 (18).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Witherbloom Apprentice
Ornithopter
Sol Ring
Lightning Bolt
Mountain
Mountain x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Witherbloom Apprentice.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
Bot1.Pass
